sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Login Page
    participant API as FastAPI Auth API
    participant Sec as Security Service
    participant DB as MySQL

    User->>UI: Submit email and password
    UI->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>DB: Load user and roles
    DB-->>API: User record, password hash, status
    API->>Sec: Verify password and account state

    alt Credentials valid and account active
        Sec-->>API: Verified
        API->>Sec: Create access and refresh tokens
        Sec-->>API: Signed tokens
        API->>DB: Persist refresh token and audit log
        API-->>UI: Access token, refresh token, user profile
        UI->>UI: Store session and route by role
        UI-->>User: Open student, teacher, or admin workspace
    else Invalid credentials or locked account
        API->>DB: Increment failure counters
        API-->>UI: 401 or 423 response
        UI-->>User: Show error feedback
    end
